#command
# IMPORTANT: Keep the explicit ^L repaint on both half-page and full-page moves.
# In tmux + Ghostty, removing these bindings causes visible stale-row artifacts:
# Ctrl-D/Ctrl-U may still look fine, but Space/PageDown/PageUp/B will ghost.
^D         forw-scroll ^L
^U         back-scroll ^L
\40        forw-screen ^L
b          back-screen ^L
\kD        forw-screen ^L
\kU        back-screen ^L
